# For lane E (wave 36, T4 — every yes/no is the decision-area pop-up). Seat 0
# (human) holds Steam Vents in an uncontested turn-1 Main Phase 1 with no land
# played yet. Playing it hits the card's own replacement ("As Steam Vents
# enters, you may pay 2 life", `UnlessCost$ PayLife<2>` in
# `res/cardsfolder/s/steam_vents.txt`), which reaches InputConfirm's Yes/No
# pair (`PlayerControllerHuman.confirmReplacementEffect` → `confirmPayment` →
# `HumanCostDecision.visit(CostPayLife)`) — the confirm the pop-up must carry.
